# Prompt 58 T2 (wave D location_oat_v2): every row is a --full extract
# (51 MB each, 21 rows = 1.07 GB). The four gz tables (bus_lmps, line_flows,
# renewables, thermal) stay in $GROUP storage on CRC and are listed by name +
# md5 in each extract_manifest.json; the collector commits only the slim
# tables + pool_full_metrics.json + runtimes.csv + the manifest (about 60 MB
# in git for the wave). Earlier --full extracts (smoke_v2, base_2019_v2 run 1)
# were committed before this rule and stay tracked.
extracts/location_oat_v2/**/*.csv.gz
# Prompt 52 v2.1 (noise_v3, batches A and B): same policy, every row --full.
extracts/noise_v3/**/*.csv.gz
# base_v3 (the identity-v3 base, one --full row): same policy; the four gz
# tables stay in $GROUP storage, listed by name + md5 in extract_manifest.json.
extracts/base_v3/**/*.csv.gz
